2760   GFX LINE X-2,Y-2,X+41,Y+49,FN W3K_C(12,7),BF
2770   GFX LINE X+2,Y+2,X+37,Y+45,FN W3K_C(8,3),BF
2780   GFX LINE X+2,Y+2,X+37,Y+45,FN W3K_C(12,10),B
2790   GFX LINE X+19,Y+2,X+20,Y+45,FN W3K_C(12,10)
2800   GFX LINE X+2,Y+23,X+37,Y+24,FN W3K_C(12,10)
2810   GFX LINE X+5,Y+5,X+10,Y+12,FN W3K_C(8,12)
